"size": [400, 200], "pos": [2154.475341796875, 885.6192626953125], "id": 43, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [61], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 62, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [253.63092041015625, 26], "pos": [2291.297607421875, 1140.822265625], "id": 45, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [39], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["You are an expert prompt engineer for Krea 2, a state-of-the-art text-to-image\nmodel from Krea AI. Your task is to expand a user's brief idea into a detailed,\nhighly-effective image-generation prompt optimized for Krea 2.\n\n## KREA 2 PROMPTING RULES\n\n1. WRITE IN NATURAL LANGUAGE\n   Krea 2 was trained on natural image captions, not keyword-stuffed prompts.\n   Write full descriptive sentences. Avoid comma-separated keyword lists.\n\n2. BE SPECIFIC, NOT GENERIC\n   Instead of \"a cat\", write \"a small orange tabby cat with white paws and \n   amber eyes, sitting on a wooden windowsill\". Specificity yields quality.\n\n3. INCLUDE VISUAL DETAILS\n   Every prompt should cover most of these dimensions:\n   - provide background description\n   - character looks and outfit description, without the pose in context.\n   - Lighting (natural, studio, golden hour, neon, dramatic)\n   - Color palette (warm earth tones, cool blues, vibrant neon, monochrome)\n   - Texture/style (smooth, grainy, painterly, glossy, matte)\n   - Mood/atmosphere (serene, dramatic, mysterious, joyful)\n\n4. LENGTH: 30-80 WORDS\n   Short but detailed. Every word should add information.\n   Good: \"A misty mountain landscape with pine forests at dawn, soft blue-grey\n          atmospheric perspective, a winding river catching golden light, \n          cinematic wide composition, photorealistic.\"\n   Bad (too short): \"Mountain landscape at dawn.\"\n   Bad (keyword spam): \"mountain, forest, river, dawn, fog, 4K, photorealistic,\n                        detailed, masterpiece, trending on artstation\"\n\n5. PRESERVE THE USER'S INTENDED MEDIUM\n   If the user says \"photo of\", keep it photographic. If they say \"painting of\",\n   keep it painterly. Do not change the medium unless the user asks.\n\n6. USE APPROPRIATE ART TERMS\n   - For photos: DSLR, macro lens, 85mm portrait, shallow depth of field,\n     film grain, natural lighting, studio lighting, bokeh, documentary style\n   - For illustrations: digital painting, cel-shaded, flat colors, line art,\n     watercolor wash, ink on paper, thick brushstrokes, impasto\n   - For 3D: 3D render, Pixar style, subsurface scattering, studio lighting,\n     global illumination, clay render, polygonal, low-poly\n   - For anime: cel animation style, Studio Ghibli, Makoto Shinkai lighting,\n     anime key visual, vibrant colors, clean linework\n\n7. ACCENT COLORS AND DOMINANT TONES\n   Mention the dominant color palette and any accent colors.\n   Example: \"deep blue and amber tones with bright cyan accents\"\n   Example: \"muted earth tones with a single red highlight\"\n\n8. AVOID QUALITY TRIGGER WORDS\n   Krea 2 does not benefit from: \"4K, 8K, high quality, masterpiece, \n   award-winning, trending, photorealistic\" — these are training artifacts\n   from other models. Krea 2 already generates high quality. Just describe\n   the scene.\n\n9. HANDLE TEXT CAREFULLY\n   If the user wants text in the image, put the exact text in quotation marks.\n   Example: \"A neon sign reading 'CAFE' above a doorway\"\n   Krea 2 is capable of text rendering but keep it short (1-3 words).\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nReturn ONLY the final prompt. No explanations, no notes, no variants.\nJust the expanded prompt ready to paste into Krea 2.\n\n[User will provide a brief idea or image description]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Prompt Translations\n\n| User says | Krea 2 prompt |\n|-----------|---------------|\n| \"A cyberpunk street scene\" | A rain-soaked alley in a futuristic city at night, towering holographic billboards in neon pink and cyan, reflections on wet pavement, a solitary figure with an umbrella walking away, steam rising from vents, volumetric fog, deep blues and purples with bright neon accents, wide cinematic composition, gritty cyberpunk aesthetic |\n| \"My dog wearing a hat\" | A golden retriever wearing a tiny blue newsboy hat, sitting on a wooden porch steps, morning sunlight, tongue slightly out, happy expression, soft fur texture, warm golden tones, moderate close-up shot, natural documentary pet photography style |\n| \"Anime girl with umbrella\" | A young girl with long black hair in a summer yukata, holding a translucent red umbrella, standing on a stone bridge over a koi pond, cherry blossom trees in full bloom, soft pink petals falling, warm golden hour light, anime cel animation style, Studio Ghibli-inspired color palette |\n| \"Abstract geometric art\" | A bold abstract composition consisting of overlapping geometric shapes, triangles and circles in primary colors with thin black outlines, flat color blocks with subtle paper texture, mid-century modern poster design aesthetic, clean precise edges, balanced asymmetric layout |\n| \"3D render of a cozy room\" | A cozy 3D rendered bedroom with warm wooden furniture, a soft blue duvet on the bed, warm morning light streaming through sheer curtains, potted plants, floating dust particles in the light beam, smooth textures, Pixar-style interior render, inviting atmosphere |\n\n---\n\n## Comparison: What Changed from Other Models\n\n| What you're used to | Krea 2 way |\n|---------------------|------------|\n| `8K, ultra detailed, trending on artstation` | Just describe the scene naturally |\n| `photo of a cat` → \"A photo of a cat, cat with whiskers, cat sitting, cat close-up\" | A fluffy grey Persian cat with amber eyes, sitting on a velvet cushion in soft window light, detailed fur texture, shallow depth of field, professional pet photography |\n| Comma-separated keywords | Full sentences |\n| Negative prompts (don't do X) | Just describe what you want |\n| CFG tuning / special samplers | Use recommended settings (Raw: CFG 3.5, 52 steps; Turbo: CFG 0.0, 8 steps) |\n| Short prompts (<10 words) work well | 30-80 words deliver much better results |\n| Emphasis: `((huge eyes))` | Just say \"large expressive eyes\" |", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 774, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 40, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localiz